[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:15]: Setting up console commands:
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: run [] - Runs effects in specified file
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: techpoints - Adds 1000 tech points of each kind to the player
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: nextsong - Changes the currently playing soundtrack.
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: listsongs - Shows all available songs
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: morehumans(humans) [num] - Adds more humans
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: window(wnd) [Arguments: open/close] [window gui name] - Opens or closes the specified window
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: reload [file name] - Reloads the gui or lua file
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: reloadinterface - Reloads the entire interface
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: reloadfx [Arguments: map/mapname/postfx or *.fx filename] - Reloads the shader
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: reloadtexture [texture file name. Example: gfx/models/itup_pikeman_spec.dds] - Reloads the specified texture
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: reloadloc [0] - Reloads the localisation
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: reloadgovernmentflavor [0] - Reloads the government flavor
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: reloadevents [0] - Reloads the event database
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: reloadpositions [0] - Reloads the council position database
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: event [event id] [<Character ID>] - Executes an event
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: decision [decision id] [<Character ID>] - Executes a decision
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: charinfo(debug_mode) - Adds debug info to character status info
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: eventinfo - Adds debug info to character status info
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: numcoas - Prints the number of used coat of arms
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: succ [<Succession Type>] - Changes the succession type ( WARNING, Dangerous )
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: recalc_succ [<Character ID>] - Recalculate the succession for a character or the player
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: validate_lieges [<Title Name>] - Validates the liege of a title
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: validate_laws [<Character ID>] - Validates the laws of a characters primary holding
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: allow_laws - Toggles the ability to change laws freely
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: validate_cultural_names - Validates cultural title names
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: age [<Character ID> (optional)] [<Age>] - Sets a characters age
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: add_diplomacy [<Character ID>] [<Delta>] - Modifies a characters diplomacy stat
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: add_stewardship [<Character ID>] [<Delta>] - Modifies a characters stewardship stat
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: add_learning [<Character ID>] [<Delta>] - Modifies a characters learning stat
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: add_intrigue [<Character ID>] [<Delta>] - Modifies a characters intrigue stat
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: add_martial [<Character ID>] [<Delta>] - Modifies a characters martial stat
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: enable_ambition [<Character ID>] - Allows a character to pick a new ambition
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: clear - Clears the console
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: discover_plots - Toggles auto plot discovery
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: give_title [<Title Name>] [<Character ID>] - Gives a title to a character
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: murder [<Character ID>( Murderer )] [<Character ID>( Victim )] [<Auto success>( 1/0 )] [<Auto discover>( 1/0 )] - One character attempts to murder another
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: testevent [<Event ID>] [<Character ID>] - Tests an event without triggering it
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: nickname [<Nickname>] [<Character ID>] - Gives a character or the player a nickname
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: pollinate [<Character ID>( Mother )] [<Character ID>( Father )] - Impregnates a character by another character
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: cuckoo [<Character ID>( Mother )] [<Character ID>( Father )] - Impregnates a character by another character, father unknown
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: give_birth [<Character ID>( Mother )] - Causes a character to give birth
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: add_lover [<Character ID>( First )] [<Character ID>( Second )] - Makes two characters lovers
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: refresh_portraits - Sets all character portraits to be refreshed asap
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: add_trait [<Trait Name>, <Character ID>] - Adds a trait to a character
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: add_modifier [<Modifier Name>, <Character ID>, <Days>] - Adds a modifier to a character
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: remove_trait [<Trait Name>, <Character ID>] - Removes a trait from a character
[ConsoleCmdManager.cpp:23]: remove_modifier [<Modifier Name>, <Character ID>] - Removes a modifier from a character
